==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Sweets for Sniffles]] in order to do [[Quest:Nature's Cure]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Silverspark]] located in [[Unicorn Forest]], [[Pony Vale]].
==Objectives==
Pass out Yarith's Chocolate Ice Cream Mixed Remedy to the rest of the Unicorns in Unicorn Forest.
*'''Cure sneezing Unicorns - /5'''<br>Take Yarith's Chocolate Ice Cream Mixed Remedy to the rest of the Unicorns in Unicorn Forest.
*'''Return to Silverspark'''<br>Now that you've cured the Unicorns of their sneezing it's time to tell Silverspark all about Xeydia and her vile plants.
